-- `device`: Torch device (CPU or CUDA) [S1, unofficial].
-- `gt_image`: Ground truth RGB image tensor of shape `[H, W, 3]` or `[1, H, W, 3]` [S2, unofficial][S3, unofficial].
+*   `coarse_model`, `fine_model`: Trained NeRF MLPs [S1, unofficial].
